$\log _{2}(x+2 y)+x^{2}+2 y^{2}+3 x y-x-y=0 \Leftrightarrow \log _{2}(x+2 y)+x^{2}+2 x y+2 y^{2}+x y-x-y=0$
$\log _{2}(x+2 y)+x(x+2 y)+y(x+2 y)+x+y=0 \Leftrightarrow \log _{2}(x+2 y)=(x+y)[1-(x+2 y)]$.
Do $\left\{\begin{array}{l}x+y>0,-20 \leq x \leq 20 \\ x+2 y>0 \\ x, y \in Z\end{array} \Rightarrow x+2 y \geq 1 \Rightarrow \log _{2}(x+2 y) \geq 0\right.$.
Mà $\left\{\begin{array}{l}x+y>0 \\ \log _{2}(x+2 y) \geq 0\end{array} \Rightarrow 1-(x+2 y) \geq 0 \Leftrightarrow x+2 y \leq 1 \Rightarrow x+2 y=1\right.$.
